  /// Run [AppleReport.runId] wrote [AppleReport.content].
  case content
  /// Run [AppleReport.runId]'s token counts.
  case usage
  /// Run [AppleReport.runId] failed: [AppleReport.failure] says how.
  case failed
  /// Run [AppleReport.runId] ended (cancelled runs too).
  case done
